{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/VoGg8yhRGl3Jr0erC6M6nQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:05.003928+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/VoGg8yhRGl3Jr0erC6M6nQ","html":"<div><p><b><font><span>为增进全国优秀大学生对中国林业科学研究院</span></font></b><font><span>木材工业</span></font><font><span>研究所的了解，搭建学术科研交流平台，激发青年学子对木材科学与技术的热情和兴趣，我单位计划</span></font><font><span>于</span></font><font><span>8</span></font><font><span>月</span></font><font><span>19</span></font><font><span>日</span></font><font><span>-20</span></font><font><span>日</span></font><font><span>通过</span></font><font><span>腾讯视频会议</span></font><font><span>举办中国林业科学研究院</span></font><font><span>木材工业</span></font><font><span>研究所</span></font><span>2026</span><font><span>年</span></font><font><span>“木材科学与技术”暑期</span></font><font><span>大学生夏令营，欢迎有意愿报考我单位研究生的优秀大学生报名参加。</span></font></p><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><strong><span><span>研究所简介</span></span></strong></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><font><span>中国林业科学研究院木材工业研究所</span></font><font><span></span></font><font><span>于</span></font><font><span>1957</span></font><font><span>年</span></font><font><span>3</span></font><font><span>月</span></font><font><span>14</span></font><font><span>日成立，</span></font><font><span>是</span></font><font><span>国家林业和草原局所属中国林业科学研究院下设的木材科学技术</span></font><font><span>领域</span></font><font><span>综合性国家级研究机构，同时为国际林业研究组织联盟团体会员，是林业系统第一个林业工程博士后流动站设站单位</span></font><font><span>，</span></font><font><span>围绕</span></font><font><span>“双碳”目标、乡村振兴等国家战略需求，</span></font><font><span>开展基础与应用基础研究。研究领域</span></font><font><span>涵盖</span></font><font><span>木材构造与利用、木材物理与干燥、木材力学与木结构、木材化学与改性、木材保护与阻燃、木质功能材料、木质复合材料、人造板及胶粘剂、</span></font><font><span>木质生态工程材料</span></font><font><span>、</span></font><font><span>家具与木制品、木材工业标准化与产业政策</span></font><font><span>、林业装备与信息化</span></font><font><span>等。</span></font><font><span>现有</span></font><font><span>研究创新团队</span></font><font><span>14</span></font><font><span>个，设有</span></font><font><span>木材科学与技术</span></font><font><span>二级学科</span></font><font><span>博士、硕士</span></font><font><span>学位点</span></font><font><span>和材料与化工硕士专业学位授权点</span></font><font><span>，现可招收木材科学与技术学术型博士研究生和硕士研究生、林业装备与信息化学术型博士研究生和硕士研究生、材料与化工专业硕士研究生，累计培养研究生</span></font><font><span>572</span></font><font><span>人。</span></font></p><p><font><span>单位拥有馆藏量亚洲第一的国家林业和草原局木材标本资源库、我国首个</span></font><font><span>“</span></font><font><span>CITES</span></font><font><span>全球野生动植物鉴定实验室</span></font><font><span>”、行业唯一的新序列林木生物质低碳高效利用国家工程中心、国家人造板质检中心、国家木竹产业联盟、古建筑木材国家文物局重点科研基地</span></font><font><span>、</span></font><font><span>木材国家</span></font><font><span>林业和草原局</span></font><font><span>重点实验室</span></font><font><span>、木结构国家</span></font><font><span>林业和草原局</span></font><font><span>重点实验室</span></font><font><span>及多个中国林科院研究生实践</span></font><font><span>基地</span></font><font><span>。</span></font></p><p><font><span>现有在职人员</span></font><span>1</span><font><span>57</span></font><font><span>人，其中博士生导师</span></font><font><span>27</span></font><font><span>人，硕士生导师</span></font><font><span>30</span></font><font><span>人；副高</span></font><font><span>及</span></font><font><span>以上专业技术人员</span></font><font><span>110</span></font><font><span>人；拥有国际木材科学院院士</span></font><font><span>6</span></font><font><span>人</span></font><font><span>、</span></font><font><span>国家杰出青年科学基金获得者</span></font><span>1</span><font><span>人</span></font><font><span>、国家优秀青年科学基金获得者</span></font><font><span>1</span></font><font><span>人、</span></font><font><span>新世纪百千万人才工程国家级人选</span></font><span>1</span><font><span>人</span></font><font><span>、</span></font><font><span>万人计划中青年科技创新领军人才</span></font><font><span>2</span></font><font><span>人</span></font><font><span>；</span></font><font><span>中央国家机关会计领军人才</span></font><font><span>1</span></font><font><span>人</span></font><font><span>、</span></font><font><span>全国林业系统先进工作者</span></font><span>1</span><font><span>人</span></font><font><span>、全国</span></font><font><span>林业系统教学名师</span></font><span>1</span><font><span>人</span></font><font><span>、</span></font><font><span>国家</span></font><font><span>林业和草原局林草科技创新团队</span></font><font><span>5</span></font><font><span>个、</span></font><font><span>“百千万”人选</span></font><font><span>9</span></font><font><span>人、</span></font><font><span>林草科技创新</span></font><font><span>领军人才</span></font><font><span>3</span></font><font><span>人、青年拔尖</span></font><font><span>人才</span></font><font><span>5</span></font><font><span>人；中国林科院首席科学家</span></font><font><span>2</span></font><font><span>人、卓越师生团队</span></font><font><span>1</span></font><font><span>个</span></font><font><span>，</span></font><font><span>多人在国际学术组织任职，</span></font><font><span>是一支学科齐全、布局合理、专业配套，结构优化的科研队伍。</span></font></p><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><strong><span><span>拟定活动安排</span></span></strong></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><font><span>1.</span></font><font><span>院所介绍及研究生培养情况介绍；</span></font></p><p><font><span>2.</span></font><font><span>特色专题报告；</span></font></p><p><font><span>3.</span></font><font><span>研究团队介绍；</span></font></p><p><font><span>4.</span></font><font><span>营员个人展示（</span></font><font><span>5</span></font><font><span>分钟</span></font><font><span>PPT</span></font><font><span>介绍）；</span></font></p><p><font><span>5.</span></font><font><span>互动交流。</span></font></p><section><section><section><section><section><font><font><b><font><span><br/></span></font></b></font></font></section><section><section><font><font><b><font><strong><span><span>申请条件</span></span></strong></font></b></font></font></section></section><section><section><font><font><b><font><span><br/></span></font></b></font></font></section><section><section><section><font><b><font><span><br/></span></font></b></font></section><section><font><b><font><span><br/></span></font></b></font></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><font><span>申请夏令营的同学须同时具备以下条件：</span></font></p><p><font><span>1.</span></font><font><span>拥护中国共产党的领导，政治立场坚定，遵纪守法，品行端正，诚实守信，身心健康；</span></font></p><p><font><span>2.</span></font><font><span>全国高等院校、科研院所</span></font><font><span>2027</span></font><font><span>年应届毕业生；</span></font></p><p><font><span>3.</span></font><font><span>品学兼优，英语水平较好，无补考或重修记录，未受过纪律处分；</span></font></p><p><font><span>4.</span></font><font><span>具有浓厚的科研兴趣，较强的创新意识和创新能力，有志于从事林草科学研究。</span></font></p><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><strong><span><span>申请材料</span></span></strong></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><font><span>1.</span></font><font><span>《木材所</span></font><font><span>2026</span></font><font><span>年大学生暑期夏令营活动申请表》（见附件）；</span></font></p><p><font><span>2.</span></font><font><span>申请人个人简历</span></font><font><span>1</span></font><font><span>份；</span></font></p><p><font><span>3.</span></font><font><span>英语水平证明（如四</span></font><font><span>/</span></font><font><span>六级、雅思、</span></font><font><span>TOEFL</span></font><font><span>或</span></font><font><span>GRE/GMAT</span></font><font><span>等）；</span></font></p><p><font><span>4.</span></font><font><span>其他证明材料（能证明个人学术水平的有代表性的学术论文首页、专利及各类获奖证书等）。</span></font></p><p><font><span>按照</span></font><font><span>1-</span></font><font><span>申请表、</span></font><font><span>2-</span></font><font><span>个人简历、</span></font><font><span>3-</span></font><font><span>英语水平证明、</span></font><font><span>4-</span></font><font><span>其他证明材料的顺序进行排列，整合成一个</span></font><font><span>PDF</span></font><font><span>文件（首页附材料清单）。文件命名规则：木材所</span></font><font><span>2026</span></font><font><span>年夏令营申请</span></font><font><span>+</span></font><font><span>姓名</span></font><font><span>+</span></font><font><span>学校名称。</span></font></p><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><strong><span><span>报名时间及方式</span></span></strong></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><font><span>报名自即日起开放，截止时间为</span></font><font><span>8</span></font><font><span>月</span></font><font><span>16</span></font><font><span>日下午</span></font><font><span>17</span></font><font><span>点，</span><span>扫描二维码进行报名，同时将报名申请表及其他材料发送至邮箱</span></font><font><span>zxm@caf.ac.cn</span></font><font><span>，邮件主题名称：木材所</span></font><font><span>2026</span></font><font><span>年夏令营申请</span></font><font><span>+</span></font><font><span>姓名</span></font><font><span>+</span></font><font><span>学校名称。</span></font></p><p><font><span><span>扫码报名</span></span></font></p><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/rD6jJ0FjehZibS8gwBgmWK2DHLpDt3vWRquAnIDvkibe3v4wcNKj4ub4CvWHsMhgJYQnepvIqXBqpnamrbibxCuOiapHCtOMCpnvfDWpGhicxSAw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><font><span><br/></span></font></p><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><strong><span><span>入营名单</span></span></strong></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><font><span>我所将于</span></font><font><span>8</span></font><font><span>月</span></font><font><span>17</span></font><font><span>日前完成入营资格审核，以电子邮件或电话形式通知入营人员，并将入营名单在所网公布，未入营者不再另行通知。</span></font></p><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><strong><span><span>注意事项</span></span></strong></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><font><span>1.</span></font><font><span>申请人必须确保申请材料真实可靠，资格审查不合格或弄虚作假者将取消营员资格。</span></font></p><p><font><span>2.</span></font><font><span>参加人员应遵守夏令营的安排和要求，按时参加各项活动。</span></font></p><p><font><span>3.</span></font><font><span>夏令营具体活动安排另行通知。</span></font></p><p><font><span>4.</span></font><font><span>本次活动不收取任何费用。</span></font></p><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><strong><span><span>联系方式</span></span></strong></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><font><span>联系电话：</span></font><font><span>010-62889414</span></font><font><span>（张老师）</span></font></p><p><font><span>电子邮箱：</span></font><font><span>zxm@caf.ac.cn</span></font></p><p><font><span>地址：北京海淀区香山路中国林科院木材工业研究所</span></font></p><p><span> </span></p><p><font><span>中国林业科学研究院木材工业研究所</span></font></p><p><font><span>2026</span></font><font><span>年</span></font><font><span>8</span></font><font><span>月</span></font><font><span>3</span></font><font><span>日</span></font></p><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/vnT4hbaLoX7CVwP3ChLicpEFMN4RzYLOyxiaPdQs9RtH7fCkor7q6hFGNRS1r5nKGePKcxibtZhVRBUGzazn9Ahkw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/vnT4hbaLoX7CVwP3ChLicpEFMN4RzYLOyeBqEfA6xwxIVK2EGGuWQPXenZ3qzXFiaA3oo88ndlcrvPZg3MU5RjGg/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section><section><section><b><span>扫码下载申请表</span></b></section></section></section></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/rD6jJ0FjehZl30racQQHtjJ5iaU13A1hb7C9XuuZibSTPyKLRCKsnCXR4oQljp9IQQFwDOpl3D1Js5sslygJha0gYqvYo9fPwuicSD05fucBqc/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"9b6f3f42f02004dd3f5247cb858df3b1be99d4ecbbd95a699fea3a325cf63479","textLength":1784,"sourceSha256":"3644865db5883a784c2bd0b7f805868ca93dea4b9295c21a94d629284bd4392a","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-4db3e536e721d9c0d23f","title":"2026年中国林业科学研究院木材工业研究所2026年“木材科学与技术”暑期大学生夏令营通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:05.003928+00:00"}
